WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.667
Abacoa Digital. Great at the work. Buried in the rest.
An HVAC owner juggles staff and deliveries while the phone rings.

00:04.667 --> 00:09.333
Elliot, the AI receptionist, answers the call.

00:09.333 --> 00:15.000
Maya wipes sweat from her forehead as her children run and complain.
The AC is broken, and she needs help today.

00:15.000 --> 00:19.833
Elliot offers the available 3 PM appointment. Maya agrees.

00:19.833 --> 00:25.333
The appointment is confirmed and the urgent request is flagged for the owner.

00:25.333 --> 00:31.125
The owner checks his laptop. Maya's 3 PM appointment is already booked.
The CRM shows the AC problem, children at home, and urgent flag.

00:31.125 --> 00:34.042
The owner calls his team to get rolling on Maya's urgent job.

00:34.042 --> 00:38.042
The owner sends the team alert, with the appointment and job details attached.
This is an illustrative workflow with sample data.

00:38.042 --> 00:40.042
Abacoa Digital. You do the work. We connect the rest.
